<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2083807488"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1708217999"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ドラマチックに恋したい"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="小玉ひかり"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ドラマチックに恋したい"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:18.093"><div begin="00:00.840" end="03:10.868"><p begin="00:00.840" end="00:03.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Are you ready to fall in fall in love with me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你准备好与我坠入爱河了吗？</span></p><p begin="00:03.741" end="00:09.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I wanna let you know when I have a crush on you! you!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你知道我什么时候喜欢上你了!</span></p><p begin="00:09.943" end="00:12.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">キュンな展開は乙女の願いだ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人心动的进展是少女的愿望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyu n na te n ka i wa o to me no ne ga i da</span></p><p begin="00:12.720" end="00:13.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">憧れじゃだめ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">憧憬不行吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ko ga re ja da me ？</span></p><p begin="00:14.071" end="00:15.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">刺激足りない！ない！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不够刺激 不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ge ki ta ri na i na i</span></p><p begin="00:15.923" end="00:17.316" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">世界を癒す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">疗愈世界的恋爱光束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wo i ya su ko i no bi i mu</span></p><p begin="00:17.398" end="00:18.798" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">恋のビーム<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋的光束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wo i ya su ko i no bi i mu</span></p><p begin="00:18.798" end="00:21.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">愛されたいし愛したいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要被你所爱 也想要爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i sa re ta i shi a i shi ta i no</span></p><p begin="00:21.943" end="00:23.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">曖昧な衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暧昧的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da n ma i na sho u do u</span></p><p begin="00:23.119" end="00:24.546" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">会いたい！君はどう？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想见你 你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i ki mi wa do u ？</span></p><p begin="00:24.546" end="00:26.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">視線をキャッチして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">捕捉你的视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi se n wo kya 'c chi shi te</span></p><p begin="00:28.010" end="00:29.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">未来予想図<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未来预想图里 几乎都有你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i yo so u zu da i ta i ki mi to i ru</span></p><p begin="00:29.072" end="00:30.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">大体君といる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大概你也在其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i yo so u zu da i ta i ki mi to i ru</span></p><p begin="00:30.571" end="00:32.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">夢が膨らむ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想逐渐膨胀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ga fu ku ra mu</span></p><p begin="00:32.801" end="00:35.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">隠してた想いがあたし飛び越えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐藏的心意跨越了我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi te ta o mo i ga a ta shi to bi ko e te</span></p><p begin="00:35.978" end="00:39.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ふたりきりうるさい心臓<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人独处心脏便吵嚷聒噪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri ki ri u ru sa i shi n zo u</span></p><p begin="00:39.346" end="00:44.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">鈍感な君はまだ気づかないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迟钝的你却还是没有发现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n ka n na ki mi wa ma da ki zu ka na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:44.812" end="00:46.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">分かってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ru</span></p><p begin="00:46.291" end="00:50.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">視線の先はあたしじゃないこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你视线前方的人不是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi se n no sa ki wa a ta shi ja na i ko to</span></p><p begin="00:51.163" end="00:54.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">それでも願ってしまう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此我还是期望着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ne ga 't te shi ma u</span></p><p begin="00:54.167" end="00:57.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">君とのラブストーリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我和你之间的爱情故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to no ra bu su to o ri i</span></p><p begin="00:58.503" end="01:01.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ドラマチックに恋したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想谈一场戏剧性的恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ra ma chi 'k ku ni ko i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="01:01.502" end="01:04.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">ロマンチックに愛したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向往着一场浪漫的爱情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro ma n chi 'k ku ni a i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="01:04.280" end="01:08.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">本気であたしを攫ってみせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试着认真地来虏获我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n ki de a ta shi wo sa ra 't te mi se te</span></p><p begin="01:08.258" end="01:10.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Fall in love with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你坠入爱河</span></p><p begin="01:10.309" end="01:13.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">回り回って選んでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辗转于众人间做出选择</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri ma wa 't te e ra n de ne</span></p><p begin="01:13.371" end="01:16.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">ハッピーエンドで笑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用幸福结局让我欢笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha 'p pi i e n do de wa ra wa se te</span></p><p begin="01:16.463" end="01:19.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">君と見たい景色があるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还有想和你一起看到的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to mi ta i ke shi ki ga a ru no</span></p><p begin="01:19.481" end="01:22.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">君の隣はあたしがいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是最适合在你身边的那个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no to na ri wa a ta shi ga i i no</span></p><p begin="01:22.337" end="01:23.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">覚えておいて？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可要记好啰？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo e te o i te ？</span></p><p begin="01:26.405" end="01:27.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">さながらハンター！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像是猎人一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa na ga ra ha n ta a</span></p><p begin="01:27.541" end="01:29.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">作戦会議でburn out!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在作战会议上燃起斗志</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ku se n ka i gi de burn out</span></p><p begin="01:29.064" end="01:31.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">宿敵キューティーガール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宿敌都是可爱的女孩子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shu ku te ki kyu u ti i ga a ru</span></p><p begin="01:32.450" end="01:33.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">やっぱり勝てない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然我根本毫无胜算嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 'b ba ri ka te na i</span></p><p begin="01:33.562" end="01:37.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">きっぱり諦めないと傷つくだけと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不干脆一点放弃的话 一定只会让自己受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa 'p pa ri a ki ra me na i to ki zu tsu ku da ke to</span></p><p begin="01:37.261" end="01:38.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">わかってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:38.745" end="01:40.647" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">素直になれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦对上你的视线 我就会变得无法坦率</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na o ni na re na i ki mi to me ga a u to</span></p><p begin="01:40.651" end="01:43.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">君と目が合うと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要和你面面相觑</span></p><p begin="01:43.693" end="01:50.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">それでも自分に嘘はつきたくないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ji bu n ni u so wa</span></p><p begin="01:52.453" end="01:55.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">I wanna change...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想做出改变…</span></p><p begin="01:55.492" end="02:00.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I wanna be only only your heroine...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想成为仅你的女主角…</span></p><p begin="02:08.202" end="02:10.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I CAN! 声に出さなきゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须大声说出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I can ko e ni da sa na kya</span></p><p begin="02:11.240" end="02:13.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I DO! 言葉にしなきゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须要向你告白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I do ko to ba ni shi na kya</span></p><p begin="02:14.046" end="02:16.948" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">クヨクヨしてないでほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再这样闷闷不乐了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku yo ku yo shi te na i de ho ra</span></p><p begin="02:17.032" end="02:20.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">あたし、君が...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 其实对你……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ki mi ga</span></p><p begin="02:20.999" end="02:23.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">"ドラマチックに恋したい"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“想谈一场戏剧性的恋爱”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ do ra ma chi 'k ku ni ko i shi ta i ”</span></p><p begin="02:23.985" end="02:26.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ドラマチックに恋したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想谈一场戏剧性的恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ra ma chi 'k ku ni ko i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:26.962" end="02:29.734" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">ロマンチックに愛したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向往着一场浪漫的爱情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro ma n chi 'k ku ni a i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:29.800" end="02:33.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">本気であたしを攫ってみせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试着认真地来虏获我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n ki de a ta shi wo sa ra 't te mi se te</span></p><p begin="02:33.728" end="02:35.672" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Fall in love with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你坠入爱河</span></p><p begin="02:35.788" end="02:38.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">回り回って選んでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辗转于众人间做出选择</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri ma wa 't te e ra n de ne</span></p><p begin="02:38.847" end="02:41.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">ハッピーエンドで笑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用幸福结局让我欢笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha 'p pi i e n do de wa ra wa se te</span></p><p begin="02:42.010" end="02:44.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">君と見たい景色があるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还有想和你一起看到的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to mi ta i ke shi ki ga a ru no</span></p><p begin="02:44.984" end="02:47.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">君の隣はあたしがいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是最适合在你身边的那个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no to na ri wa a ta shi ga i i no</span></p><p begin="02:47.853" end="02:49.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">覚えておいて？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可要记好啰？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo e te o i te ？</span></p><p begin="02:50.969" end="02:53.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">秘密の愛言葉を交わそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们相互诉说秘密的爱的告白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu no a i ko to ba wo ka wa so u</span></p><p begin="02:53.959" end="02:56.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">刺激的な毎日でどうぞ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经准备好迎接刺激的每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ge ki te ki na ma i ni chi de do u zo</span></p><p begin="02:56.777" end="02:59.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">My sweet darling!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的甜心，我亲爱的</span></p><p begin="02:59.415" end="03:02.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">キュンな展開は乙女の願いだ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人心动的进展是少女的愿望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyu n na te n ka i wa o to me no ne ga i da</span></p><p begin="03:02.267" end="03:03.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">憧れじゃだめ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">憧憬不行吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ko ga re ja da me ？</span></p><p begin="03:03.546" end="03:05.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">刺激足りない！ない！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不够刺激 不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ge ki ta ri na i na i</span></p><p begin="03:05.409" end="03:06.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">世界を癒す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">疗愈世界的恋爱光束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wo i ya su ko i no bi i mu</span></p><p begin="03:06.922" end="03:08.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">恋のビーム<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋的光束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wo i ya su ko i no bi i mu</span></p><p begin="03:08.251" end="03:10.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">愛されたいし愛したいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要被你所爱 也想要爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i sa re ta i shi a i shi ta i no</span></p></div></body></tt>